  "body": "Now Priced at $4.795M  (CV $5.550m)  - Open Home this Saturday 11.00am\r\n\r\nTurn-Key Elegance, Effortless St Heliers Living.\r\n\r\nThis is the kind of home that makes an instant impression beautifully renovated, exceptionally spacious and ready for you to simply move in and start making memories.\r\n\r\nBehind electric gates, this elegant English-inspired residence delivers an impressive 425sqm (approx.) of living, with four to five bedrooms, three-and-a-half bathrooms and three generous living areas, including a fantastic space for teenagers, guests or a second family zone.\r\n\r\nAt the heart of the home is the spectacular open-plan kitchen and living area, designed for family life and effortless entertaining. French doors open wide to the westerly patios, lawn and gardens, creating a seamless indoor-outdoor connection and capturing the afternoon sun.\r\n\r\nTwo gas fireplaces add warmth and character to the formal living spaces, while central heating and air conditioning ensure year-round comfort. Beautifully proportioned hallways provide the perfect backdrop for art, while a dedicated laundry adds practicality to this exceptionally well-considered home.\r\n\r\nOutside, the lifestyle continues. There is an internal-access double garage with excellent storage, secure off-street parking and even a concrete pad for your small boat and flag pole for the family crest or All Blacks flag.\r\n\r\nAnd then there is the location. St Heliers Village is just a stroll away, meaning dinner, coffee, the beach and everything the village has to offer are within easy reach, without needing to get in the car. Excellent schooling and convenient bus routes are also close at hand.\r\n\r\nWith 1,072sqm (mol) of freehold land, generous proportions and an extensive top-to-toe renovation, this is a rare opportunity to secure a substantial, sophisticated family home in one of St Heliers' most sought-after locations.\r\n\r\nSimply arrive, unpack and enjoy. This is turn-key St Heliers living at its very best.\r\n\r\n* Freehold\r\n* Land: 1,072sqm (mol)\r\n* Floor area: 425sqm (approx.)\r\n* Priced at $4,795,000\r\n* CV: $5,550,000 (2024)\r\n* Rates: $14,088.85 p/a (2025/26)\r\n* School zones: St Heliers School, St Ignatius Catholic School, Glendowie College, Baradene College\r\n* Zone: Residential - Mixed Housing Urban\r\n* Rental appraisal: $1,600-$1,800 per week\r\n\r\nPlease call Jayne Kiely 021 352 007 or Amy Robertson 0274 820 100\r\n\r\nWe work with all agencies. Conjunctions are welcome.",
